'''Taste of Success (Merciless)''' is the fourth event stage in the game where the player can receive a large amount of XP upon completing. Like other XP stages, it consists entirely of [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies, excluding [[Ms. Sign]]. It can only be cleared once per appearance. It was added in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]].

